I am home in my kitchen.
I put on my apron.
I read the recipe on my phone.
The recipe is very clear.
It says: First, chop the onions very finely.
Then, put the meat in a large bowl.
Afterwards, add an egg and a little flour.
Finally, mix it all thoroughly together.
I find a cutting board and a sharp knife.
I cut the two yellow onions into small pieces.
My eyes water a little.
I open the package with the five hundred grams of minced pork.
I put the meat into my large, blue bowl.
Then I put the onions down with the meat.
I crack the egg into the bowl.
Afterwards, I sprinkle a little flour over it.
I take a large spoon and stir it all together.
The meat mixture looks really good.
The first step was very easy.
